{"updated":"2026-09-22T12:21:59.436Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: New book by Princess Diana's brother sparks royal ruckus. Elsewhere, macron calls on EU to tackle soaring energy prices. And media ban 'an escalation even for Trump'. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 1.2 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 2.3 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 3.6 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 40 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.3 near 97 km S of Sarangani, Philippines. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.29,0.35,0.4,0.43,0.48,0.52,0.55,0.58,0.61,0.64,0.7,0.81,0.89,1.04,1.32,1.44,1.49,1.51,1.53,1.58,1.6,1.63,1.65,1.7,1.73,1.81,1.86,1.9,1.94,1.99,2.03,2.07,2.1,2.16,2.22,2.26,2.3,2.36,2.4,2.45,2.51,2.54,2.6,2.67,2.74,2.86,2.95,3.06,3.1,3.13,3.17,3.23,3.27,3.33,3.42,3.51,3.55,3.61,3.66,3.7,3.75,3.8,3.84,3.87,3.89,3.94,3.96,3.98,4,4.05,4.1,4.18,4.24,4.31,4.39,4.45,4.56,4.6,4.66,4.68,4.72,4.84,4.99,5.17,5.68,5.79,5.88,5.91,5.96,6,6.05,6.11,6.19,6.28,6.37,6.44,6.5,6.55,6.59,6.63,6.68,6.73,6.82,6.86,6.91,6.97,7.01,7.13,7.2,7.26,7.33,7.36,7.38,7.43,7.48,7.52,7.58,7.64,7.66,7.71,7.77,7.88,7.98,8.07,8.14,8.2,8.28,8.34,8.41,8.47,8.56,8.6,8.65,8.7,8.77,8.82,8.89,8.94,8.99,9.1,9.22,9.33,9.78,9.89,9.95,10.01,10.05,10.1,10.16,10.21,10.26,10.38,10.43,10.52,10.6,10.69,10.77,10.83,10.88,10.91,10.98,11.03,11.1,11.14,11.21,11.27,11.32,11.37,11.41,11.49,11.67,11.88,11.96,11.98,12.02,12.09,12.14,12.22,12.27,12.34,12.41,12.46,12.52,12.59,12.7,12.76,12.8,12.86,12.89,12.91,12.98,13.05,13.1,13.12,13.16,13.23,13.29,13.35,13.39,13.46,13.54,13.62,13.73,13.83,13.92,14.3,14.37,14.43,14.48,14.57,14.62,14.69,14.76,14.84